**Regression caught during verification:** excising the nested `_uc_probe` helper from
`DigitalTwin.fetch_digital_twin_existence` over-reached and consumed the function's tail —
the `asyncio.gather`, every `result[...]` assignment and the `return`. The function silently
returned `None`, which surfaced as `AttributeError: 'NoneType' object has no attribute
'get'` on `GET /validate/detailed`. Reconstructed the tail from HEAD. This is why the
suite runs after each step rather than only at the end.

