Tests: `uv run --frozen pytest -m "not scenario and not e2e and not live_integration"
-p no:randomly` → **4772 passed, 21 skipped, 283 deselected in 23.84s**. The 7 co-tenancy
`db` tests still pass against the live Azure server (19.09s). No new ruff violations
(1 before, 1 after).
